Add opt-in `--translation-cache`, a bounded process-local translation table over
semantic module keys and module-qualified names. Repeated batch requests reuse
unchanged translations while preparing and verifying fresh tasks. No disk or
verification-result cache is enabled; the default translation path is unchanged.
Named module verification tasks retain their own proof-dependency maps through
translation hits, coverage and diagnostic reporting, without merging unrelated
module state into the program-wide map.
